        <dc:title>For Her: A Furry Pregnancy Story</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="Rahheemme" opf:role="aut">Rahheemme</dc:creator>
        <dc:contributor opf:file-as="calibre" opf:role="bkp">calibre (3.42.0) [https://calibre-ebook.com]</dc:contributor>
        <dc:date>2018-06-29T00:00:00+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:description>&lt;p&gt;Daphodille ('Daph' to her friends) is a city-squirrel, born and raised in New York City. Active, sporty, eccentric, an adrenaline junkie, and with a mouth like a sailor, there's nobody quite like Daph. But she's entering her mid-twenties at an unexpected standstill, unsure of where to take her life beyond the day-by-day. It all changes when her best friend Georgia asks her for a surprising favor: she wants Daph to act as the surrogate mother to her baby, to go through the pregnancy she herself can't.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over nine months of change, discovery, love, sex, friendship, and family, Daph grows in more ways than one as a big favor transforms her entire life.   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;18+ for sexual content and language&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
